<title>USA: ASR Investments sees 1996 besting 1995.</title>
<headline>ASR Investments sees 1996 besting 1995.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apartment real estate investment trust ASR Investments Corp said on Wednesday it expects 1996 net income and cash provided by operations to exceed 1995 results.</p>
<p>ASR said in February it had 1995 net income of $6.6 million, and $7.9 million of cash provided by operations.</p>
</text>
